  "rows": [
    {
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "source_text": "ふう……。何とかオーディションが終わりました。\nやはり、雨彦への反応が良かったですね。",
      "text_ref": null,
      "speaker": {
        "kind": "named",
        "entityType": null,
        "entityId": null,
        "sourceName": "古論 クリス"
      },
      "inline_translation": null,
      "has_voice": true,
      "anchor": {
        "row_id": "1_4_001_04_f:step-4:text",
        "step_id": 4,
        "step_index": 3,
        "source_part_id": "1_4_001_04_f",
        "source_file": null,
        "command_start": null,
        "command_end": null,
        "playback": {
          "file": "episodes/1_4_001_04_f.json",
          "start_step_index": 0,
          "end_step_index": 23,
          "target_step_index": 3
        }
      },
      "option": null
    },
    {
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "source_text": "……どうした、北村。\n浮かない顔だが、結果が心配か？",
      "text_ref": null,
      "speaker": {
        "kind": "named",
        "entityType": null,
        "entityId": null,
        "sourceName": "葛之葉 雨彦"
      },
      "inline_translation": null,
      "has_voice": true,
      "anchor": {
        "row_id": "1_4_001_04_f:step-7:text",
        "step_id": 7,
        "step_index": 6,
        "source_part_id": "1_4_001_04_f",
        "source_file": null,
        "command_start": null,
        "command_end": null,
        "playback": {
          "file": "episodes/1_4_001_04_f.json",
          "start_step_index": 0,
          "end_step_index": 23,
          "target_step_index": 6
        }
      },
      "option": null
    },
    {
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "source_text": "心配は、物事一つに、留まらず。……結果も\n心配だけど、本当にこれで良かったのかなーって。",
      "text_ref": null,
      "speaker": {
        "kind": "named",
        "entityType": null,
        "entityId": null,
        "sourceName": "北村 想楽"
      },
      "inline_translation": null,
      "has_voice": true,
      "anchor": {
        "row_id": "1_4_001_04_f:step-11:text",
        "step_id": 11,
        "step_index": 10,
        "source_part_id": "1_4_001_04_f",
        "source_file": null,
        "command_start": null,
        "command_end": null,
        "playback": {
          "file": "episodes/1_4_001_04_f.json",
          "start_step_index": 0,
          "end_step_index": 23,
          "target_step_index": 10
        }
      },
      "option": null
    },
    {
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "source_text": "「ユニットの魅力や自分らしさを伝えることが\n大事」って、プロデューサーさんは言ってたよねー。",
      "text_ref": null,
      "speaker": {
        "kind": "named",
        "entityType": null,
        "entityId": null,
        "sourceName": "北村 想楽"
      },
      "inline_translation": null,
      "has_voice": true,
      "anchor": {
        "row_id": "1_4_001_04_f:step-12:text",
        "step_id": 12,
        "step_index": 11,
        "source_part_id": "1_4_001_04_f",
        "source_file": null,
        "command_start": null,
        "command_end": null,
        "playback": {
          "file": "episodes/1_4_001_04_f.json",
          "start_step_index": 0,
          "end_step_index": 23,
          "target_step_index": 11
        }
      },
      "option": null
    },
    {
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "source_text": "確かに、雨彦さんの魅力は伝わったと思うけど……。\n逆に言えば、それだけっていうかー。",
      "text_ref": null,
      "speaker": {
        "kind": "named",
        "entityType": null,
        "entityId": null,
        "sourceName": "北村 想楽"
      },
      "inline_translation": null,
      "has_voice": true,
      "anchor": {
        "row_id": "1_4_001_04_f:step-13:text",
        "step_id": 13,
        "step_index": 12,
        "source_part_id": "1_4_001_04_f",
        "source_file": null,
        "command_start": null,
        "command_end": null,
        "playback": {
          "file": "episodes/1_4_001_04_f.json",
          "start_step_index": 0,
          "end_step_index": 23,
          "target_step_index": 12
        }
      },
      "option": null
    },
    {
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "source_text": "正直、ユニットとしての魅力は伝えられてない\n気がするしー……3人が採用される理由はないよねー。",
      "text_ref": null,
      "speaker": {
        "kind": "named",
        "entityType": null,
        "entityId": null,
        "sourceName": "北村 想楽"
      },
      "inline_translation": null,
      "has_voice": true,
      "anchor": {
        "row_id": "1_4_001_04_f:step-14:text",
        "step_id": 14,
        "step_index": 13,
        "source_part_id": "1_4_001_04_f",
        "source_file": null,
        "command_start": null,
        "command_end": null,
        "playback": {
          "file": "episodes/1_4_001_04_f.json",
          "start_step_index": 0,
          "end_step_index": 23,
          "target_step_index": 13
        }
      },
      "option": null
    },
    {
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "source_text": "すまないね、残ってもらって。\nさて、オーディションの感想なんだが……。",
      "text_ref": null,
      "speaker": {
        "kind": "named",
        "entityType": null,
        "entityId": null,
        "sourceName": "番組P"
      },
      "inline_translation": null,
      "has_voice": false,
      "anchor": {
        "row_id": "1_4_001_04_f:step-19:text",
        "step_id": 19,
        "step_index": 18,
        "source_part_id": "1_4_001_04_f",
        "source_file": null,
        "command_start": null,
        "command_end": null,
        "playback": {
          "file": "episodes/1_4_001_04_f.json",
          "start_step_index": 0,
          "end_step_index": 23,
          "target_step_index": 18
        }
      },
      "option": null
    },
    {
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "source_text": "葛之葉クン、彼は素晴らしい！\n掃除のテクニックも申し分なさそうだ。……だが。",
      "text_ref": null,
      "speaker": {
        "kind": "named",
        "entityType": null,
        "entityId": null,
        "sourceName": "番組P"
      },
      "inline_translation": null,
      "has_voice": false,
      "anchor": {
        "row_id": "1_4_001_04_f:step-20:text",
        "step_id": 20,
        "step_index": 19,
        "source_part_id": "1_4_001_04_f",
        "source_file": null,
        "command_start": null,
        "command_end": null,
        "playback": {
          "file": "episodes/1_4_001_04_f.json",
          "start_step_index": 0,
          "end_step_index": 23,
          "target_step_index": 19
        }
      },
      "option": null
    },
    {
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "source_text": "北村想楽さん、古論クリスさん。\nこの二人の詳細も気になりますよね。",
      "text_ref": null,
      "speaker": {
        "kind": "producer",
        "entityType": null,
        "entityId": null,
        "sourceName": "<P>"
      },
      "inline_translation": null,
      "has_voice": false,
      "anchor": {
        "row_id": "1_4_001_04_f:step-21:text",
        "step_id": 21,
        "step_index": 20,
        "source_part_id": "1_4_001_04_f",
        "source_file": null,
        "command_start": null,
        "command_end": null,
        "playback": {
          "file": "episodes/1_4_001_04_f.json",
          "start_step_index": 0,
          "end_step_index": 23,
          "target_step_index": 20
        }
      },
      "option": null
    },
    {
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "source_text": "そうなんだよ！　僕の番組の視聴者は、\n掃除のテクニックだけじゃなくて……",
      "text_ref": null,
      "speaker": {
        "kind": "named",
        "entityType": null,
        "entityId": null,
        "sourceName": "番組P"
      },
      "inline_translation": null,
      "has_voice": false,
      "anchor": {
        "row_id": "1_4_001_04_f:step-22:text",
        "step_id": 22,
        "step_index": 21,
        "source_part_id": "1_4_001_04_f",
        "source_file": null,
        "command_start": null,
        "command_end": null,
        "playback": {
          "file": "episodes/1_4_001_04_f.json",
          "start_step_index": 0,
          "end_step_index": 23,
          "target_step_index": 21
        }
      },
      "option": null
    },
    {
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "source_text": "出演しているアイドルの人間性にも、\n興味を示すんだ。",
      "text_ref": null,
      "speaker": {
        "kind": "named",
        "entityType": null,
        "entityId": null,
        "sourceName": "番組P"
      },
      "inline_translation": null,
      "has_voice": false,
      "anchor": {
        "row_id": "1_4_001_04_f:step-23:text",
        "step_id": 23,
        "step_index": 22,
        "source_part_id": "1_4_001_04_f",
        "source_file": null,
        "command_start": null,
        "command_end": null,
        "playback": {
          "file": "episodes/1_4_001_04_f.json",
          "start_step_index": 0,
          "end_step_index": 23,
          "target_step_index": 22
        }
      },
      "option": null
    },
    {
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "source_text": "だから、もう少し話を聞かせて欲しい。\n彼らはどんな人間で、どんなユニットなのかを！",
      "text_ref": null,
      "speaker": {
        "kind": "named",
        "entityType": null,
        "entityId": null,
        "sourceName": "番組P"
      },
      "inline_translation": null,
      "has_voice": false,
      "anchor": {
        "row_id": "1_4_001_04_f:step-24:text",
        "step_id": 24,
        "step_index": 23,
        "source_part_id": "1_4_001_04_f",
        "source_file": null,
        "command_start": null,
        "command_end": null,
